<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="cat-30a0-30b0-30c0-0001" name="Legiones Astartes" revision="18" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="sys-a1d2-5ede-e74f-7479" gameSystemRevision="7" type="catalogue">
  <comment>Revision 18: Added the complete core Fast Attack section: Legion Seekers, Bikes, Sky Hunters, Attack Bikes, Land Speeders and Javelin Attack Speeders, using shared weapon/transport links and source-accurate points and options.</comment>
  <readme>Core Troops, Elites and Fast Attack entries follow the current Legiones Astartes Army List. Shared weapons and transports are reused through links rather than duplicated. Unit-specific replacements take precedence over generic Armoury access, squad-wide upgrades suppress redundant character purchases where practical, and items may not be selected more than once unless specifically permitted.</readme>
  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Bolter" hidden="false" id="gear-bolter">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Bolter" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="prof-bolter">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">24"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Rapid Fire</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
