                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="techmarine-II-servo-1-rad-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
                  </constraints>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="10" />
                  </costs>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Rad Missiles" id="techmarine-II-servo-1-rad-rule" hidden="false">
                      <description>Legal only if this Servo-automata has a Missile Launcher and its Legion Techmarine is equipped with Rad Grenades. Replace the Missile Launcher's Frag and Krak Missiles with Rad Missiles: 48", S4, AP3, Heavy 1, Blast, Fleshbane, Rad-phage. A surviving model that suffers an unsaved Wound from Rad-phage loses 1 Toughness for the rest of the battle, minimum 1; cumulative.</description>
