                  <description>May only be selected if the Detachment includes a Siege Breaker or another model whose rules specifically permit access to Phosphex ammunition. This requirement must be satisfied elsewhere in the roster.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Lingering Death" id="rapier-phosphex-linger" hidden="false">
                  <description>After resolving the attack, leave the Blast marker in place. For the remainder of the battle, the area beneath the marker counts as Dangerous Terrain for non-vehicle models and Open-topped vehicles.</description>
