        <rule name="Strafing Run" id="fa-javelin-strafe" hidden="false">
          <description>When shooting Assault, Heavy, Rapid Fire or Salvo weapons at ground units that are not Flyers or Skimmers, the vehicle gains +1 Ballistic Skill and all such shots count as Pinning, as defined in ProHammer Classic.</description>
